  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD support to Trocaire partners for response to food crisis in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project shall provide people affected by drought and food insecurity in five different locations in Kenya access to food and support their livelihood for a period of 6 months. The project is going to be implemented by partners of Trocaire and is part of a larger food crisis proposal by a consortium between CAFOD and Trocaire.</narrative>
  </description>
